{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_fastifybackend", "label": "FastifyBackend", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default und Produktionsempfehlung; Fastify ist eine feste Dependency von actor-ts, Express und Hono sind optionale Peers. Durchsatz 150K-200K req/s auf Bun, 80K-120K auf Node 22."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_bodylimit", "label": "bodyLimit (1 MiB Default)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Das eine, das das Framework fuer dich setzt - derselbe Cap wie bei Express und Hono, damit nicht mehr das Backend entscheidet, welche Requests angenommen werden. Ein eigener Wert gewinnt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_trustproxy", "label": "trustProxy", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Konfigurierbar, weil die Konstruktor-Optionen direkt an Fastify durchgereicht werden - dann aber in der Trusted-Subnet-Form ('10.9.9.0/24'). true traut jedem Hop und macht req.ip zum linkesten, client-geschriebenen Eintrag; eine Hop-Anzahl vergleicht nur Indizes und nie Adressen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_withplugin", "label": "backend.withPlugin / backend.fastify", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Escape-Hatch fuer Plugins ausserhalb der DSL (JWT, Swagger, CORS, Kompression); Plugins, die Routen registrieren, vor dem Binden registrieren, wenn Pfade ueberlappen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_tls", "label": "Fastify-TLS / mTLS", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Standard-Fastify-TLS-Optionen inklusive requestCert/rejectUnauthorized; fuer die meisten Produktions-Setups terminiert TLS am Load-Balancer."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_lifecycle", "label": "Backend-Lifecycle bis Fastify.close()", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "close() wartet auf laufende Requests, bevor es resolved - passt zur service-unbind-Phase des Coordinated Shutdown."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_logger_noise", "label": "Fastifys Logger nicht neben actor-ts-Log", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dupliziert das Logging von actor-ts; logger: false lassen und system.log fuer strukturiertes Logging nutzen."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_fastifybackend", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_bodylimit", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/backends/fastify.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_fastifybackend", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_fastify_trustproxy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/